Aṅgada denies steadfastness purity compassion in Sugrīva --- Aṅgada condemns seizing brother wife and sealing cave mouth --- Aṅgada condemns forgetting Rāma and ordering search from fear --- Aṅgada distrusts ungrateful Sugrīva fearing prison death --- Aṅgada vows seashore fast over return and bids monkeys leave --- Aṅgada sends homage to Sugrīva Rumā and comfort to Tārā --- Aṅgada lies weeping on darbha grass --- Monkeys weep blame Sugrīva praise Vālin and sit fasting
